      "text": "Jesus did not commit himself unto them, John 2:24. hath committed all judgment unto the Son, John 5:22. Whosoever committeth sin is the servant of sin, John 8:34. unto them were committed the oracles of God, Rom. 3:2. dispensation of the gospel is committed unto me, 1 Cor. 9:17. hath committed unto us the word of reconciliation, 2 Cor. 5:19. commit the keeping of their souls to him, 1 Pet. 4:19. He that committeth sin is of the devil, 1 Jn. 3:8.",
